{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicksharing Tycoon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kicksharing Tycoon is an economic strategy in which you create and develop your own electric scooter rental company. Starting with a garage and a couple of scooters, you can build a real international corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Startup from scratch - buy your first scooters for your last $10,000 and start your entrepreneurial journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business management - assign cities for rent, monitor the condition of the fleet, hire staff and expand to new cities and countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realism and challenges - cope with vandalism and government requirements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible strategy - decide whether you will personally control the details or build a system that works without your participation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a small garage business into a leader in the global micromobility industry?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Airborn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979650/01552b5a17af1e795bd96f5bfbaaf52639aaa485.jpg"},{"name":"I'am millionare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979650/522e848007fb067fd247c7443e2cdf56c51dd92e.jpg"},{"name":"I'am a billionare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979650/c27315b0a5fdbd20a2af96eb61e49d92dc5fd1e5.jpg"},{"name":"100000 scooters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979650/e057fc4a98604cc6d9f14b5da8f8dfd5e05a967e.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979650?t=1764707153","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979650/fb008be38e1fc1dcd09783bb9e9374c8d9b41446/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764707153","capsule_image":"h